concept:australian-coastal-shipping-commission-act-1964-sec-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1 Section 1"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1.) This Act may be cited as the Australian Coastal Shipping Commission Act 1964. *Act No. 41, 1956, as amended by No. 87, 1962.  1964. Australian Coastal Shipping Commission. N o . 88. (2.) The Australian Coastal Shipping Commission Act 1956— 1962* is in this Act referred to as the Principal Act. (3.) The Principal Act, as amended by this Act, may be cited as the Australian Coastal Shipping Commission Act 1956-1964. Commencement. 2 . This Act shall come into operation on the day on which it receives the Royal Assent. Terms and conditions of employment." ;
    skos:definition "(1.) This Act may be cited as the Australian Coastal Shipping Commission Act 1964. *Act No. 41, 1956, as amended by No. 87, 1962.  1964. Australian Coastal Shipping Commission. N o . 88. (2.) The Australian Coastal Shipping Commission Act 1956— 1962* is in this Act referred to as the Principal Act. (3.) The Principal Act, as amended by this Act, may be cited as the Australian Coastal Shipping Commission Act 1956-1964. Commencement. 2 . This Act shall come into operation on the day on which it receives the Royal Assent. Terms and conditions of employment."@en ;
