concept:australian-coastal-shipping-commission-act-1964-sec-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Section 3"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "Section twenty-two of the Principal Act is amended by omitting from sub-section (2.) the words \" T w o thousand five h u n d r e d \" and inserting in their stead the words \" T h r e e thousand five h u n d r e d \" ." ;
    skos:definition "Section twenty-two of the Principal Act is amended by omitting from sub-section (2.) the words \" T w o thousand five h u n d r e d \" and inserting in their stead the words \" T h r e e thousand five h u n d r e d \" ."@en ;
